Vālin crashes like felled tree and Indra banner --- Indra necklace preserves fallen Vālin splendor --- Rāma arrow grants heaven to stricken Vālin --- Rāma with Lakṣmaṇa nears lion-chested Vālin --- Vālin denounces back-shooting as unrighteous cruelty --- Vālin pleads forest ape never harms Rāma realm --- Vālin claims face-fight would yield Yama and offers Rāvaṇa capture --- Vālin offers retrieving Sītā from sea or netherworld --- Vālin demands fit reply then falls silent